{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extended version of Void of Lilly comes to Steam for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/f8dc833a528ca545a1ed1ddceac3fbe4.avif?t=1753544465\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long time ago, people faced the Black Fog disease. That's how Axis city became the last bastion of humanity. Years of progress within total isolation, and now it's a beautiful place, filled with advanced techologies. But you aren't really interested in all af this stuff, right? You just want to find your sister and bring her back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short story-focused game with a few JRPG elements, beautiful pixel art and BULLET HELL battles!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/extras/d5a227fc49c03ff0fb2ce636ed971f13.avif?t=1753544465\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Ann to find her sister in a short 60-120 minutes adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack your enemies in Bullet Hell fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out the secret of the world's biggest corporation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the world's mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet the cats and find easter eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look at the beautiful wallpaper in your smartphone at any time</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866140?t=1753544465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866140?t=1753544465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866140/e16330f1caa7aec1fe6a12d8477fab0ecb9873bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753544465","capsule_imagev5":"http